      "level": 2,
      "content": "8.1 Char Dham Yatra"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "The Chota Char Dham Yatra includes four sacred Himalayan shrines: Yamunotri, Gangotri, Kedarnath, and Badrinath.",
        "Panch Kedar comprises five holy Shiva temples in the Garhwal region: Kedarnath, Tungnath, Rudranath, Madhyamaheshwar, and Kalpeshwar.",
        "Panch Badri consists of five revered temples dedicated to Lord Vishnu: Badrinath (Vishal Badri), Yog Dhyan Badri, Bhavishya Badri, Vridha Badri, and Adi Badri.",
        "Tungnath holds the distinction of being the highest Shiva temple in the world."
      ],
      "id": "lghxdex"
    },
